# Spike evidence frames: regenerated by the harnesses, so the working set is not kept in
# history -- fifty megabytes of it. The curated final frames the closeout actually cites
# live in `frames/evidence/` and ARE tracked, which is why this ignores the directory's
# contents rather than the directory itself (git cannot re-include a path whose parent
# directory is excluded).
docs/superpowers/spike/frames/*
!docs/superpowers/spike/frames/evidence/
